  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装（120PCS）",
    "en": "Kids DIY Fort Building Set (120PCS)"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭的DIY插珠帐篷套装，采用杆件与连接球组合，可搭建帐篷、城堡等立体造型，适用于亲子互动、课堂游戏与活动空间布置。\n\n产品品牌为尧顺，主要材质为PP，常用规格为YG120PCS，支持外贸渠道与电商场景配套供货。",
    "en": "This is a DIY fort-building set for children’s creative construction play. Using rods and connector balls, it can be assembled into tents, castles, and other 3D shapes for parent-child interaction, classroom games, and play-area setup.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Main material: PP. A common configuration is YG120PCS, suitable for export channels and e-commerce supply."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装以“杆件+连接球”结构为核心，孩子可根据空间与主题需求自由搭建帐篷、城堡和通道造型，适用于家庭与教学场景。",
      "产品主材为PP，配置包含YG120PCS规格，兼顾轻量化与结构稳定性，便于重复拆装与形态重构。导购视频可用于渠道展示和上架说明。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，适合跨境电商与线下渠道批量采购。可结合年龄段和市场定位进行组合配置，支持持续供货。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids DIY fort set is built around a rod-and-connector system. Children can freely create tents, castles, and tunnel-like structures based on space and play themes, making it suitable for home and educational use.",
      "The main material is PP, with a YG120PCS configuration that balances lightweight handling and structural stability. It supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration, and guide videos are available for channel presentation.",
      "The item is packed in a color box and fits cross-border e-commerce and offline bulk procurement. Configurations can be adjusted by age group and market positioning for long-term supply."
    ]
  },
